  "details": "Description\n\ni'm having a bug where whenever I start the game and I try to connect to my home world with the steam vr menu still open it gets stuck on connecting\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nlaunch vrchat, keep the steam vr menu open. it might also depend on me using a quest 3 connecting to my pc using virtual desktop and having the desktop open while the game is launching.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1885-81193b80fa-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-12_19-49-11.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_628d3ca4-5e77-440c-96c9-d33aadba37b9/1/file)",
